---
description:ы
globs:
alwaysApply: true
---

- If files are specified in gitignore and are needed by the project, they are not deleted
- All files unrelated to the project are deleted from the project
- No temporary or automatically generated files should be added to git add
- Environment files are not subject to deletion
-  Do not add an infinite number of unnecessary files and directories to gitignore. Files that do not appear in the project should not be added either, especially dependencies that are not present in the project. 